      "title": {
        "en": "Meals"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Poles eat *śniadanie* (breakfast) *rano*, *obiad* (the main, hot meal) in the afternoon, and *kolacja* (supper) in the evening. Say what you eat with *na* and the accusative: *na śniadanie jem bułkę*, *co jesz na obiad?* *Obiad* has a *pierwsze danie* (often *zupa*) and a *drugie danie*, the main course."
      }
    }
  ],
